		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδηλέομαι</span> (q.v.).
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδαλίων</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who walks on
				stilts</i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάδαλοι</span></b> , οἱ, <i>stilts</i>, <i><span class="en">
